     4 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
     5 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.001 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.053 seconds

labelmap atom 1 stic 2 hinge

group stickers         type 1
2000 atoms in group stickers
group hinges           type 2
1000 atoms in group hinges

